  "releaseNotes": "19.0.0\n* New offline validation engine: Validate()/ValidateAsync() now accept an extendedValidation parameter to validate locally, without calling the remote service\n* Updated for Factur-X 1.0.9.2 / Valitool 3.26\n* QuotaExceededException, InvalidFacturXDataException and FileTooLargeException are now public and sealed, so they can be caught directly\n* Fixed error handling for oversized files and quota errors returned by the remote service",
